1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,625
You@Well, I think you have pets, right?

2
00:00:06,975 --> 00:00:08,300
Bella@why do you think so

3
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:14,275
You@Judging from your appearance, you look beautiful and kind-hearted. You are definitely a caring person.

4
00:00:14,550 --> 00:00:17,472
Bella@Haha, yup! I’ve got four doggos~

5
00:00:17,725 --> 00:00:20,250
You@Wow, you see, I guessed it right.

6
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:22,174
Bella@Yeah, yeah, it's pretty awesome.

7
00:00:22,174 --> 00:00:24,125
Bella@No joke, my dogs are crazy cute.

8
00:00:24,125 --> 00:00:26,267
Bella@There’s this one super hyper dog—

9
00:00:26,267 --> 00:00:28,070
Bella@every time I get home, she just sprints around like crazy

10
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:29,957
Bella@and slams right into me.

11
00:00:30,350 --> 00:00:31,425
Bella@I end up on the floor every single time.

12
00:00:33,025 --> 00:00:34,225
You@So enthusiastic

13
00:00:34,625 --> 00:00:36,650
Bella@Then there is another one who likes to sing very much

14
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:40,882
Bella@As long as you tell it the keyword, it will start singing.

15
00:00:40,882 --> 00:00:43,150
Bella@So I often hear the quartet at home

16
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:45,950
You@Then I think your dog is quite lively and can form a singing group.

17
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:48,525
Bella@Seriously, do you think they are cute?

